1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:02,900
Hello everyone and welcome to EnglishPod.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:03,480
My name is Marco.

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:09,480
My name is Katherine and this is our 300th lesson here at EnglishPod, so it's a special lesson.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,920
But today we're talking a little bit about dating.

5
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,040
That's right.

6
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:21,700
Today we're going to talk about dating now in a little bit of a less conventional way, a new type of dating, very modern with using technology.

7
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,740
Using technology, that's right.

8
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:26,840
So let's listen to today's dialogue and we'll be back in a moment.

9
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,480
Do you want to hang out tomorrow?

10
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,570
Oh, I can't.

11
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:38,400
I have a date.

12
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,400
Really?

13
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,400
Wow.

14
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,400
With who?

15
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,590
This girl I've been chatting with for the past couple of months.

16
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,350
She's really cool and she's driving over here this weekend.

17
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:47,450
Wait a minute.

18
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,050
You mean you met her online?

19
00:00:51,070 --> 00:00:51,350
Yeah.

20
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:54,950
I signed up for a website called match.com and it's great.

21
