00:10:56,400 --> 00:11:03,760
All right, so talking about setting up, this is another word that comes to mind when your friends set you up for a date is a blind date.

223
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:07,980
Okay, so a blind date is not a date with two blind people.

224
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:14,640
A blind date is a date that you go to when you don't know who the other person is before you go.

225
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:15,300
That's right.

226
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:20,560
